```plantuml
@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman

actor "普通用户" as User
actor "定时任务" as Scheduler
actor "微信消息服务" as WX

rectangle "时间模块" {
  usecase "设置解锁时间" as UC1
  usecase "查看已解锁记录" as UC2
  usecase "自动解锁到期记录" as UC3
  usecase "发送解锁提醒" as UC4
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
Scheduler --> UC3
WX --> UC4
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>
@enduml
```